  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development to which this permission relates must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of the decision notice. \rReason: To comply with the provisions of S.51 of the Planning & Compulsory Purchase Act 2004.\r",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the approved plans, \r\rDrawing No. 01, 03, 03 replacement tree, 04, Heritage Statement \r\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "Prior to the works commencing on site, details of the cobblestones and finishing materials of the front boundary wall and pier shall be submitted to and approved in writing.\r\rReason: To ensure a satisfactory appearance in the Meadway Conservation Area.\r",
    "The replacement Magnolia Stellata as shown on the submitted plan 03 shall be planted in the first planting season after the removal of the ornamental olive tree.  If the tree dies, becomes severely damaged or diseased within five years of planting it shall be replaced with a new tree in accordance with the approved details. \r\rReason: To provide a satisfactory appearance in the Meadway Conservation Area.\r"
